# Fixed 2026-09-18: './data' and './output' were never valid gitignore patterns,
# so both trees were untracked-but-committable (4.5 GB / 285 MB).
# Both forms are listed on purpose: a trailing slash matches directories only,
# and on the Mila cluster these names are SYMLINKS into $SCRATCH (see
# scripts/mila_setup.sh), which git treats as files.
/data
/data/
output
output/
logs
logs/
future_work
future_work/
